        "TileImage": "$($repository 2a3846bc-0e5c-47cc-a513-f88a5ff43850).Image",
        "Description": "Good day, 47.\rWe&apos;ve managed to track down the next deal of the European gun smuggling syndicate &quot;Omicron&quot;.\rThey have sent several undercover trucks to the Sanguine Fashion Show, planning to strike a deal with a local protest gang. If we eliminate their representative and his bodyguards, we will deal a major blow to their western branch.\rMake sure to keep panic to a minimum and to not eliminate innocent event staff.",
